  data: {
    LLM: "Reach the 51-point opening as soon as possible. Use Aces (11 pts) and Face cards (10 pts) to hit the threshold quickly.\n\nJoker Fishing: Keep a card in your hand that could swap a Joker on the table. Even if it doesn't help your meld immediately, having a Joker in hand is a powerful defensive tool.\n\nDiscard Suppression: Watch your opponents. If an opponent has melded once, they can 'tack' onto your cards. Avoid playing cards that extend existing runs if you think an opponent is close to going out.",
